        "Title": "BCR Vol. 90 - Homecoming",
        "Location": "LOCATION_GOLDEN_GECKO",
        "PublicId": "127220956432",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 4218dd14-8024-4fef-86fb-65e97cd65f59).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rOur client has received credible intel of an imminent threat to the life of Sheikh Omar Al-Ghazali. Four members of his security detail have been planted by a foreign agency to spy on (and potentially eliminate) the Sheikh, while a civilian associate has been paid off to cover their escape. \r\rTogether, they pose an unacceptable risk to our clients interests in the Ghazali family business, and so we have been contracted to protect them. \r\rGood luck, Agent. \r\r-DK &amp; ChinGuru",
